WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.041
In this chapter, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:31.041 --> 00:00:32.166
has made clear

3
00:00:32.166 --> 00:00:34.625
that from this ocean of sorrow
that is birth and death,

4
00:00:34.625 --> 00:00:38.333
the easiest path to liberation is devotion.

5
00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:40.750
And now in the coming verses, Lord Krishna

6
00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:43.833
will describe, step by step,

7
00:00:43.833 --> 00:00:47.208
how to walk on this path of devotion.

8
00:00:47.208 --> 00:00:49.375
In this verse, Lord Krishna says –

9
00:00:49.375 --> 00:00:50.250
O Arjuna,

10
00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:53.000
fix your mind only on Me,

11
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.708
and immerse your intellect in Me too.

12
00:00:55.708 --> 00:00:59.083
By doing so, you will reside in Me alone.

13
00:01:03.708 --> 00:01:05.375
In this verse, Lord Krishna

14
00:01:05.375 --> 00:01:08.208
tells Arjuna to keep both his mind

15
00:01:08.208 --> 00:01:11.208
and intellect fixed in Him.

16
00:01:11.208 --> 00:01:13.041
Immerse them in Him alone.

17
00:01:13.041 --> 00:01:15.583
This is the highest form of devotion,

18
00:01:15.583 --> 00:01:18.291
where a person's thoughts, feelings,

19
00:01:18.291 --> 00:01:22.916
and wisdom become fully
absorbed in Lord Krishna.

20
00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:25.333
When such a deep connection forms,

21
00:01:25.333 --> 00:01:26.458
it is as if the devotee

22
00:01:26.458 --> 00:01:29.125
is residing within Lord Krishna Himself.

23
00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:31.541
That is, even while living

24
00:01:31.541 --> 00:01:34.208
in this world, Lord Krishna's presence

25
00:01:34.208 --> 00:01:37.208
is all around them; they are established in Him.

26
00:01:37.208 --> 00:01:40.583
This is true – whatever the physical location,

27
00:01:40.583 --> 00:01:42.833
wherever a person's mind is,

28
00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:44.708
that is where they truly reside.

29
00:01:44.708 --> 00:01:46.750
One who longs for wealth

30
00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:48.625
lives in dreams of wealth.

31
00:01:48.625 --> 00:01:50.625
One who desires luxury

32
00:01:50.625 --> 00:01:52.500
lives in those thoughts.

33
00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:54.583
And a true devotee of Lord Krishna,

34
00:01:54.583 --> 00:01:57.166
even while fulfilling worldly duties,

35
00:01:57.166 --> 00:02:00.458
remains constantly in
Lord Krishna's remembrance.

36
00:02:00.458 --> 00:02:01.958
The four walls around them

37
00:02:01.958 --> 00:02:05.000
are only a physical structure.

38
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:07.708
Lord Krishna Himself gives this assurance –

39
00:02:07.708 --> 00:02:11.666
he who is My devotee is always close to Me.

40
00:02:11.666 --> 00:02:13.708
And this is not a possibility.

41
00:02:13.708 --> 00:02:15.416
This is the truth.

42
00:02:15.416 --> 00:02:17.083
Just as a piece of iron

43
00:02:17.083 --> 00:02:19.458
is attracted toward a magnet,

44
00:02:19.458 --> 00:02:22.958
a devotee too, beyond all bonds,

45
00:02:22.958 --> 00:02:27.333
is drawn toward Lord Krishna.

46
00:02:27.333 --> 00:02:31.541
But many people find this devotion difficult.

47
00:02:31.541 --> 00:02:34.208
They feel a sense of inability.

48
00:02:34.208 --> 00:02:36.708
They too wish to practise devotion, but

49
00:02:36.708 --> 00:02:39.750
this restless mind keeps wandering.

50
00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:42.750
Lord Krishna understands this
concern of ours too,

51
00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:44.625
and so in the coming verses

52
00:02:44.625 --> 00:02:47.625
He will describe several levels of devotion,

53
00:02:47.625 --> 00:02:49.791
so that every person, whatever

54
00:02:49.791 --> 00:02:52.041
the situation they may be in,

55
00:02:52.041 --> 00:02:54.625
can step onto the path of devotion,

56
00:02:54.625 --> 00:02:58.958
and then gradually reach the highest devotion.

57
00:02:58.958 --> 00:03:00.166
So in a way,

58
00:03:00.166 --> 00:03:00.958
this verse

59
00:03:00.958 --> 00:03:04.041
establishes that supreme state of devotion,

60
00:03:04.041 --> 00:03:06.666
where the devotee fixes mind and intellect

61
00:03:06.666 --> 00:03:08.458
in Lord Krishna and always

62
00:03:08.458 --> 00:03:11.458
resides in Him; and then, going

63
00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:14.250
forward, of reaching this state the various

64
00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:16.000
levels are described.

65
00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.791
Because Lord Krishna Himself wishes

66
00:03:18.791 --> 00:03:21.666
to make this path so accessible

67
00:03:21.666 --> 00:03:25.375
that all devotees can reach Him.

68
00:03:29.666 --> 00:03:35.000
Arjuna will attain the highest
form of devotion only

69
00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.583
when he keeps both his mind

70
00:03:37.583 --> 00:03:42.875
and intellect fixed in Me.

71
00:03:42.875 --> 00:03:45.083
Both mind and intellect

72
00:03:45.083 --> 00:03:47.416
carry great importance.

73
00:03:47.416 --> 00:03:48.750
In life too,

74
00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:52.083
if you wish to achieve something great,

75
00:03:52.083 --> 00:03:56.125
half-hearted effort will not bring success.

76
00:03:56.125 --> 00:04:01.375
Both intellect and mind must be engaged.

77
00:04:01.375 --> 00:04:03.916
For example,

78
00:04:03.916 --> 00:04:08.541
if someone wants to become healthy,

79
00:04:08.541 --> 00:04:10.875
they make a plan for balanced nutrition,

80
00:04:10.875 --> 00:04:14.500
exercise, and so on.

81
00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:19.041
They also choose a trainer for themselves.

82
00:04:19.041 --> 00:04:20.541
But if

83
00:04:20.541 --> 00:04:25.833
at the time of exercise their
very willpower weakens,

84
00:04:25.833 --> 00:04:28.958
will they succeed?

85
00:04:28.958 --> 00:04:30.416
No, right?

86
00:04:30.416 --> 00:04:33.833
In the same way, if there is willpower,

87
00:04:33.833 --> 00:04:34.958
but no plan for

88
00:04:34.958 --> 00:04:38.958
nutritious food and exercise,

89
00:04:38.958 --> 00:04:42.875
then too complete success will not come.

90
00:04:42.875 --> 00:04:46.625
Where the intellect works in making the plan,

91
00:04:46.625 --> 00:04:47.958
there the mind

92
00:04:47.958 --> 00:04:50.541
gives the willpower to execute

93
00:04:50.541 --> 00:04:53.416
that plan.

94
00:04:53.416 --> 00:04:55.083
For success,

95
00:04:55.083 --> 00:04:57.500
both of these matter.

96
00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:59.708
If you engage both the mind

97
00:04:59.708 --> 00:05:02.291
and the intellect,

98
00:05:02.291 --> 00:05:06.750
you will certainly achieve success –

99
00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:10.333
whether it is a matter of spiritual progress,

100
00:05:10.333 --> 00:05:14.791
or any personal goal of life.

101
00:05:19.375 --> 00:05:23.333
Here the matter is of intellect and mind,

102
00:05:23.333 --> 00:05:26.666
the importance of both.

103
00:05:26.666 --> 00:05:29.125
You are on the spiritual path,

104
00:05:29.125 --> 00:05:31.208
moving forward.

105
00:05:31.208 --> 00:05:35.750
Your family's inclination toward
it is also growing.

106
00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:38.166
How beautiful this is.

107
00:05:38.166 --> 00:05:40.041
Now imagine

108
00:05:40.041 --> 00:05:44.458
that a family like yours, together,

109
00:05:44.458 --> 00:05:45.625
decides to organise

110
00:05:45.625 --> 00:05:49.583
a spiritual gathering.

111
00:05:49.583 --> 00:05:51.708
An evening of bhajan and kirtan,

112
00:05:51.708 --> 00:05:54.583
or a pilgrimage?

113
00:05:54.583 --> 00:05:56.833
Now to such a gathering

114
00:05:56.833 --> 00:06:01.375
you also invite others.

115
00:06:01.375 --> 00:06:04.375
But think about this.

116
00:06:04.375 --> 00:06:08.000
This event will succeed only

117
00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.166
when both mind and intellect

118
00:06:10.166 --> 00:06:14.583
are fully engaged in it,

119
00:06:14.583 --> 00:06:17.125
because such a gathering

120
00:06:17.125 --> 00:06:19.875
will require planning.

121
00:06:19.875 --> 00:06:22.000
Choosing the right time.

122
00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.458
Arranging all the logistics.

123
00:06:24.458 --> 00:06:27.958
A list of those to be invited,

124
00:06:27.958 --> 00:06:33.083
arranging their food and so on.

125
00:06:33.083 --> 00:06:35.541
This work is done

126
00:06:35.541 --> 00:06:37.458
through the use of intellect.

127
00:06:37.458 --> 00:06:42.291
Now the gathering is organised, but

128
00:06:42.291 --> 00:06:46.875
if you did it half-heartedly, what will happen?

129
00:06:46.875 --> 00:06:50.125
Your love, your feeling,

130
00:06:50.125 --> 00:06:54.750
feeling will touch others, not yourself.

131
00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:56.375
Because people

132
00:06:56.375 --> 00:07:00.500
have come drawn toward your love,

133
00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:03.833
not by seeing your plan.

134
00:07:03.833 --> 00:07:06.666
In this case it will all remain

135
00:07:06.666 --> 00:07:10.541
merely an activity.

136
00:07:10.541 --> 00:07:12.625
An activity

137
00:07:12.625 --> 00:07:14.250
in which spiritual fulfilment

138
00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:16.375
will not be found at all.

139
00:07:16.375 --> 00:07:18.125
On the other hand,

140
00:07:18.125 --> 00:07:22.458
if the mind is fully absorbed,

141
00:07:22.458 --> 00:07:24.666
bhajan, prayer,

142
00:07:24.666 --> 00:07:27.208
all happening from the heart,

143
00:07:27.208 --> 00:07:31.375
but some major gaps remained
in the arrangements,

144
00:07:31.375 --> 00:07:32.916
like

145
00:07:32.916 --> 00:07:35.166
mealtime arriving

146
00:07:35.166 --> 00:07:38.333
and there is nothing to eat at all,

147
00:07:38.333 --> 00:07:42.958
how much inconvenience this will give people,

148
00:07:42.958 --> 00:07:44.916
and this very inconvenience

149
00:07:44.916 --> 00:07:48.833
will pull their minds away from devotion too.

150
00:07:48.833 --> 00:07:52.166
When the intellect has a well-organised plan,

151
00:07:52.166 --> 00:07:55.875
and the mind takes part in it with love,

152
00:07:55.875 --> 00:07:57.333
only then

153
00:07:57.333 --> 00:08:01.041
the sweetness of that spiritual gathering

154
00:08:01.041 --> 00:08:04.625
will reach others.

155
00:08:04.625 --> 00:08:05.750
The importance of this union

156
00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:08.541
of intellect and mind

157
00:08:08.541 --> 00:08:11.125
will be visible to you

158
00:08:11.125 --> 00:08:15.458
in many situations of family life.

159
00:08:15.458 --> 00:08:17.291
Reflect on this.

160
00:08:22.041 --> 00:08:25.958
In professional life, true success

161
00:08:25.958 --> 00:08:29.916
is based neither on good plans alone,

162
00:08:29.916 --> 00:08:33.541
nor on hard work alone.

163
00:08:33.541 --> 00:08:36.000
If you want success,

164
00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:39.125
then planning and effort,

165
00:08:39.125 --> 00:08:41.458
a combination of both is essential.

166
00:08:41.458 --> 00:08:45.958
That is, a combination of intellect and mind.

167
00:08:45.958 --> 00:08:49.583
If you apply your intellect,

168
00:08:49.583 --> 00:08:54.833
use every technique for success,

169
00:08:54.833 --> 00:08:59.875
but the mind itself is not happy in that work,

170
00:08:59.875 --> 00:09:02.750
then everything will gradually

171
00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:05.708
start to feel like a burden.

172
00:09:05.708 --> 00:09:08.750
What use is such success

173
00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:11.750
that the world may see,

174
00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:14.541
but your own mind is not happy.

175
00:09:14.541 --> 00:09:16.250
Likewise,

176
00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:20.708
your mind is engaged in some work,

177
00:09:20.708 --> 00:09:24.666
but you do not know the right path.

178
00:09:24.666 --> 00:09:28.833
What steps to take to move forward?

179
00:09:28.833 --> 00:09:34.166
You have no framework of thought for it,

180
00:09:34.166 --> 00:09:38.625
then in such a case, in proportion
to your hard work

181
00:09:38.625 --> 00:09:41.208
you will not be able to make
that much progress.

182
00:09:41.208 --> 00:09:43.583
For example,

183
00:09:43.583 --> 00:09:45.833
there is someone

184
00:09:45.833 --> 00:09:49.875
who starts a new business.

185
00:09:49.875 --> 00:09:53.458
If they pay attention only to financial plans

186
00:09:53.458 --> 00:09:57.125
and other strategies,

187
00:09:57.125 --> 00:09:59.666
but in it enthusiasm,

188
00:09:59.666 --> 00:10:02.458
there is a lack of enthusiasm,

189
00:10:02.458 --> 00:10:06.291
then that person, after a little while,

190
00:10:06.291 --> 00:10:09.041
will tire; and if

191
00:10:09.041 --> 00:10:12.500
they have enthusiasm in plenty, but

192
00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:16.583
their work is very disorganised,

193
00:10:16.583 --> 00:10:23.458
then too the business will
not run on enthusiasm alone.

194
00:10:23.458 --> 00:10:25.458
The Bhagavad Gita's

195
00:10:25.458 --> 00:10:30.208
this principle fits well here too, that

196
00:10:30.208 --> 00:10:35.791
when mind and intellect are both focused,

197
00:10:35.791 --> 00:10:37.083
success

198
00:10:37.083 --> 00:10:39.500
only then is certain.

199
00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:42.000
This means

200
00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:44.750
that at the workplace, not only logic

201
00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:48.416
and knowledge are to be used, but

202
00:10:48.416 --> 00:10:53.666
also build an emotional connection
with your work.

203
00:10:53.666 --> 00:10:56.250
When both of these are together,

204
00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:58.666
the goal will be achieved,

205
00:10:58.666 --> 00:11:02.083
and satisfaction will also be found.

206
00:11:02.083 --> 00:11:03.833
This is what

207
00:11:03.833 --> 00:11:05.625
true success is.
